{
  "_README": [
    "Expected-machines seed for the 18 GB300 NVL72 compute trays at nvcert (rack gb300-02).",
    "NICo refuses to ingest a host not listed here (site-explorer/machine_creator.rs).",
    "Load AFTER NICo Core is up + DHCP relay is live:",
    "  ./render.sh   # substitutes BMC_PASSWORD -> expected_machines.nvcert.json (git-ignored)",
    "  kubectl cp expected_machines.nvcert.json nico-system/<admincli-pod>:/tmp/em.json",
    "  kubectl exec -n nico-system deploy/admincli -- /opt/carbide/carbide-admin-cli expected-machine replace-all --filename /tmp/em.json",
    "  (verify: ac expected-machine list ;  ac machine list)",
    "",
    "BMC = Tray BMC (AMI MegaRAC). The Tray BMC is the iface set to DHCP on 172.16.2.x that",
    "gets its IP from the control-plane (NICo). In NIC mode (DPU offload disabled) the host BMC",
    "is the managed-host entry; the DPU BMC (BlueField OpenBMC, root) is NOT the ingestion BMC.",
    "Cred admin/${BMC_PASSWORD} matches the Vault site-wide-root BMC cred already seeded.",
    "",
    "chassis_serial_number = serial-pending-tray-N \u2014 not known yet.",
    "Pull from each Tray BMC via Redfish once reachable:",
    "  GET /redfish/v1/Chassis/<id> .SerialNumber",
    "or let site-explorer learn it and update these entries after first ingestion.",
    "RackIdentifier gb300-02 = single NVL72 rack (all 18 trays in one rack)."
  ],
